{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "sky-reconnaissance-logs-of-the-divine-foal",
  "name": "Sky Reconnaissance Logs of the Divine Foal",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Sky_Reconnaissance_Logs_of_the_Divine_Foal",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-13T17:28:59.069Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 1"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Two matters to report, one good and one bad."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The good news is that the city in the sky truly exists. This discovery alone would ensure our promotion to priests upon our return!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The bad news is that we can't go back, haha."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0e227b20954ad051"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 3"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We've installed numerous secret passages and gained a preliminary understanding of this fortress's structure."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To think those barbaric Ladonians share the same noble lineage as the esteemed healers of the Twilight Courtyard? I still find this hard to believe."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fc998df1c09a62fd"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 5"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We discovered documents left by sky dwellers with extensive records of ceremonial activities. While specific forms vary by racial origin, they share a common characteristic — put simply, throwing things down from the sky."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Thinking back to folk tales about food rain from the sky and weapons falling from above, one must consider their connection to these sky rituals."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-eb100ae08f0695c7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 8"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've seen lions and heard birds sing, but never a lion imitating bird calls."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Also, the divine foal is made of wood, not a real horse — so please stop staring at me like that, it's creepy!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-288ca4163c28419a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 9"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pursued by a Pegasus, lost all our supplies."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Our provisions are nearly depleted, yet this iron-stone fortress shows not a single sign of life. What will we do when hunger truly strikes?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-75e73b39feac95c9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 10"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Found a solution."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-830e7a33aa5d0bce"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 15"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My companion could no longer endure the torment of sky-bound existence and merged his soul essence with the divine foal."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This was his choice. I was powerless to intervene."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-79e662d0c7d1d3ef"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 17"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Major breakthrough in our investigation of Skyfolk history — the complete version of the forbidden legend of the Daythunder Knight and Aquila!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Though written in a style apparently aimed at younger readers and featuring sacrilegious illustrations, it matters not. Historians should pursue knowledge with childlike eagerness."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "— Surely this isn't merely some ancient comic book, right?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cae209620168ff1a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 24"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The boredom has become unbearable. I've collected various small trinkets from around here, placed them in a box, and left it at the divine foal's resting place."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Perhaps someone will discover them in the future."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've had a revelation — could this be the true origin of treasure chests in mazes?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-36e8c423a105fc86"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Day 33"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The High Priest has come to rescue me! Praise Janus!!!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My companion has become one with the divine foal, which is deeply regrettable. I shed tears, but they were of no avail."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I record here the most important discovery of this journey as a conclusion, hoping to offer some small assistance to future generations."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e90f5c6123010cc"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "—The wooden planks of the divine foal can satisfy hunger, and their taste is quite acceptable."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5691e5fb280a541f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fd0498e2522c8f32"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
